Dal’wang buhay ang pinagsabay

1064
01:05:05,192 --> 01:05:08,988
At parang lalong naligaw

1065
01:05:09,071 --> 01:05:13,159
Isang pasaway, hilig sumuway

1066
01:05:13,242 --> 01:05:17,622
Sa akin na’ng bumubuhay
See me on that stage!

1067
